      "content": "[별표]\n한국산 배 생과실에 대한 에콰도르의 우려병해충 목록(제5조 관련)\n1. 병(5종)\nAlternaria gaisen (검은무늬병)\nBotryosphaeria berengeriana f. sp. pyricola (겹무늬병)\nGymnosporangium asiaticum (붉은별무늬병)\nMonilinia fructigena (잿빛무늬병)\nVenturia nashicola (검은별무늬병)\n2. 해충(15종)\nAcrobasis pyrivorella (배명나방)\nAdoxophyes orana (애모무늬잎말이나방)\nAphanostigma iakusuiense (콩가루벌레)\nPsylla pyricola (꼬마배나무이)\nCarposina sasakii (복숭아심식나방)\nConogethes punctiferalis (복숭아명나방)\nComstockaspis perniciosa (샌호제깍지벌레)\nGrapholita molesta (복숭아순나방)\nLepidosaphes conchiformis\nLepidosaphes ulmi (사과굴깍지벌레)\nPandemis heparana (갈색잎말이나방)\nPseudaulacaspis pentagona (뽕나무깍지벌레)\nPseudococcus comstocki (가루깍지벌레)\nAmphitetranychus viennensis (벚나무응애)\nPanonychus ulmi (사과응애)",
